## Build & run

- Open the project folder from the zip in **Android Studio** (or run `./gradlew assemble` with your Android SDK).  
- The mod doesn’t change dependencies; it augments classes/assets only.  
- Title shows the **Infinite Echoes** subtitle; **About** shows Memory Echoes. Kill a boss to see **+1** meta gain.

> Notes:
> - The Memory Echoes soft-cap expresses the **rolling memory** concept; you can later convert that counter into a capacity-gated node selection UI (“Memory Atlas”) as per your doc. fileciteturn0file0
> - Archetypes are scaffolds now; wiring these into starting kits/stat bias mirrors the Codex (Trickster/Thui, Sage/Keni, Champion/Tir, Shadow/Shanau). fileciteturn0file0
> - Codex data and Eight-Biome names live in JSON for **data-driven** modding. fileciteturn0file0 fileciteturn0file1

